&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Resources.Host-1.20.0-beta.1"&gt;Resources.Host-1.20.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Host/1.20.0-beta.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Resources.Host v1.20.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Added the &lt;code&gt;host.cpu.*&lt;/code&gt; resource attributes, emitted when&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;OTEL_DOTNET_EXPERIMENTAL_HOST_RESOURCE_ENABLE_CPU_INFO&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5173" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5173/hovercard"&gt;#5173&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated OpenTelemetry core component version(s) to &lt;code&gt;1.20.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5541" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5541/hovercard"&gt;#5541&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Resources.Host-1.20.0-beta.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Host/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Resources.ProcessRuntime-1.20.0-beta.1"&gt;Resources.ProcessRuntime-1.20.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Resources.ProcessRuntime/1.20.0-beta.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Resources.ProcessRuntime v1.20.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
