&lt;li&gt;Updated OpenTelemetry core component version(s) to &lt;code&gt;1.20.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5541" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5541/hovercard"&gt;#5541&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
