&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Resources.Gcp-1.0.0-alpha.8/src/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Gcp/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
