                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Resources.AWS-1.20.0"&gt;Resources.AWS-1.20.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Resources.AWS/1.20.0" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Resources.AWS v1.20.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;AWSECSDetector&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;AWSEKSDetector&lt;/code&gt; reporting an incorrect&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;container.id&lt;/code&gt; when the systemd cgroup driver is used.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5454" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5454/hovercard"&gt;#5454&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The metadata requests that &lt;code&gt;AWSEC2Detector&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AWSECSDetector&lt;/code&gt; and&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;AWSEKSDetector&lt;/code&gt; make while the resource is built, including reading the&lt;br&gt;
response, now time out after 1, 2 and 5 seconds respectively.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5452" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5452/hovercard"&gt;#5452&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated OpenTelemetry core component version(s) to &lt;code&gt;1.20.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5541" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5541/hovercard"&gt;#5541&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Resources.AWS-1.20.0/src/OpenTelemetry.Resources.AWS/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
